Before: sa2 = {port1.0.2, port1.0.9}. The same call's verification step was my error: I wrote the `@poll` command with `\s`
for its spaces (`@poll` takes `\s` only in the regex), so u5 got `show\sinterface\sport1.0.2\sstatus` ~28 times, each answered
