lines (a show command mistyped). The sentinel flagged it at 15:51:23; re-verified with real spaces:
`tools/tb ckcon tb470 run1537 u5 115200 --stop-on-error '@poll 45 connected\s+1\s+a-full\s+a-1000 show interface port1.0.2 status'
